sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Istio Gateway /<br/>Gateway API
    participant KnativeAct as Knative Activator
    participant AutoGluon as AutoGluon Server<br/>(FastAPI/uvicorn)
    participant gRPC as gRPC Endpoint<br/>(V2 Protocol)
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>(S3/Azure/GCS)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>(6443/TCP TLS)
    participant Controller as KServe Controller<br/>Manager
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(8443/TCP)

    Note over Client,Storage: Model Inference Request Path

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.3
    Ingress->>KnativeAct: Forward request<br/>mTLS (Service Mesh)
    KnativeAct->>AutoGluon: HTTP/8080<br/>mTLS sidecar
    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: TabularPredictor.predict()<br/>or TimeSeriesPredictor.predict()
    AutoGluon-->>KnativeAct: JSON prediction response
    KnativeAct-->>Ingress: Forward response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTP 200 JSON response

    Note over Client,gRPC: gRPC Inference Path

    Client->>Ingress: gRPC ModelInfer<br/>HTTPS/443
    Ingress->>gRPC: Forward gRPC<br/>mTLS
    gRPC->>AutoGluon: Inference request
    AutoGluon-->>gRPC: Prediction result
    gRPC-->>Ingress: gRPC response
    Ingress-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Storage,Controller: Model Loading at Startup

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService CRs<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: InferenceService created/updated
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment + Service<br/>+ VirtualService/HTTPRoute
    AutoGluon->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, IAM/credentials
    Storage-->>AutoGluon: Model files (AutoGluon format)
    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: Load TabularPredictor /<br/>TimeSeriesPredictor

    Note over Webhook,K8sAPI: Admission Control

    Client->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    Note over Prometheus,RBACProxy: Monitoring

    Prometheus->>RBACProxy: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443
    RBACProxy->>Controller: Forward to :8080<br/>localhost HTTP
    Controller-->>RBACProxy: Metrics response
    RBACProxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics (TLS terminated)
